   194	
   195	    Key insight: the preserved bbox does not show a complete checkerboard, only one side of it. The main
   196	    diagonal fixes the orientation, and transpose symmetry tells you to copy that one-sided checker clue to
   197	    the opposite triangle; then checkerboard alternation identifies the complementary parity class.
   198	    """
